{"title":"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>A bowl contains apples, oranges, pears, and bananas. The table shows how many of each type of fruit are in the bowl.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(add table: apples = 3, oranges = 6, pears = N, and bananas = 4)\n</p><p>How many of the fruits in the bowl are <i>not</i> apples?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fruits that are <i>not</i> apples would be the oranges, pears, and bananas.\n</p><p>Using the table, we can see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> oranges, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> pears, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bananas. This means that in total, there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a219443160cc10e61e4847074633c6d41bffc4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + N + 4 = N + 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" /> fruits that are <i>not</i> apples in the bowl.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051f16b8989ed5a8d31e1426c1fc0fba6dc0e698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the total number of fruits that are <i>not</i> apples in the bowl is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/9975a5e63d2881ea1dcdb08725f66cd1bf83beff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 10 = 15 + 10 = \\boxed{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"195\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC\">2022 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">Practice Relay Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" t